lution "Let $u=5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=10 x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - 2 x \\cos{\\left(5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{5}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 x^{2} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186677529 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677504}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a65e73ea-3d51-5404-b96a-5f8ce1db2360" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677504} :answer-field/id #uuid "a5683675-71ad-5da7-afc3-6f39ec053991" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677503}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "fc028ba0-f028-5d1e-ad05-ccae9e0c7366" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}} - 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}}" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=6 x.\n$$\n\nChange both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\sqrt{5} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}}^{\\frac{\\sqrt{7} \\sqrt{\\pi}}{6}} - 3 x \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x^{2} - \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate at both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{6}\\right)-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nSimplifying gives\n\n$$\n- \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186677530 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677493}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "874c8860-d002-5d4c-9834-6274554740cc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677493} :answer-field/id #uuid "20e22cb0-eb8e-5ec4-858c-74f69a20fffd" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186677469}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "fd1c4148-3a35-5bf9-9e42-774419a3d255" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int - \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{field-1}} $+C$" :question/retired true :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{5}{2 \\sqrt{x}}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting, including the required constant factor, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int - \\frac{\\sin{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2}{5}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\cos{\\left(5 \\sqrt{x} + \\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}}{5}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678240 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "18cb1952-5fc5-5a88-a712-3b7f78568b7e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678247} {:answer/id #uuid "54a26180-d229-5997-9f1f-b45542743ce5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678270} {:answer/id #uuid "64791f06-edbd-577a-8d27-973ea7a1734b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678280} {:answer/id #uuid "64dc4cda-ac84-5edf-a512-6224f2f042c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678281} {:answer/id #uuid "bbee7677-2f30-5e31-8afb-3b968cb13a97" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678313}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "64dc4cda-ac84-5edf-a512-6224f2f042c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678281} :answer-field/id #uuid "658d3fb5-a648-51b0-bba6-86e98b159369" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678282}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "02ceeebd-f46a-5ad6-a275-6126a452f