.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int x^{2} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\tan{\\left(x^{3} + 1 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678255 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ca134f58-86a7-5be5-934e-43774b4fc4c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\cot{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678318}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ca134f58-86a7-5be5-934e-43774b4fc4c0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3 \\cot{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678318} :answer-field/id #uuid "31bce280-8abe-5e70-8acf-f3e2e1341df3" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678256}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "261035cc-9a8d-5fd2-92a0-e4c3087e4f7b" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\csc^{2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x + 1}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\csc^{2}{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 1\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-3\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-3\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\