86678292} :answer-field/id #uuid "fc60f24b-f477-53e1-a964-3b01f8952def" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678340}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "52a3f685-0a30-57bc-ab64-0eded745bb85" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{1}{x + 2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=- \\frac{1}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}}{\\left(x + 2\\right)^{2}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-2\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=2 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{1}{x + 2} \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678272 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44b2fd23-e10c-51e4-8f70-6f5a97fb0169" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 6 \\cos{\\left(\\sqrt{x + 1} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678263}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "44b2fd23-e10c-51e4-8f70-6f5a97fb0169" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 6 \\cos{\\left(\\sqrt{x + 1} \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678263} :answer-field/id #uuid "9ec02247-d137-5202-8eec-f836c23fd7c6" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678300}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "5608e43a-4e25-5209-8f54-c831cf312061" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{3 \\sin{\\left(\\sqrt{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x + 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\sqrt{x + 1}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{x + 1}}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3 \\sin{\\left(\\sqrt{x + 1} \\right)}}{\\sqrt{x + 1}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=6\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n6\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- 6 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- 6 \\cos{\\left(\\sqrt{x + 1} \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678285 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "eb3b0d2f-07ca-580d-9045-492a80e9b799" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\cos{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678335}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eb3b0d2f-07ca-580d-9045-492a80e9b799" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- \\cos{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678335} :answer-field/id #uuid "03634545-7861-50d0-8f73-b4884120585a" :answer-field/key "answer" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678242}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "69206d9d-63cd-5bb9-847c-bd4494453b87" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 x \\sin{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{2} + 1$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2 x.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 x \\sin{\\left(x^{2} + 1 \\right)}\\,\\mat