ht)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=x^{3} + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3 x^{2}.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 x^{2} \\cot{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\csc{\\left(x^{3} + 2 \\right)}+C.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186678333 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01789e25-272a-58fe-9e4e-270dee3903fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678239} {:answer/id #uuid "0dcd148c-a37d-5f93-8109-9812fde37868" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678245} {:answer/id #uuid "56e15bb6-b6d0-5170-b17c-c7ec6bfda498" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678274} {:answer/id #uuid "91b44fde-4e3f-5236-9071-20f1e6648ea2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678295} {:answer/id #uuid "b95177df-864d-5167-8185-9ef07e8c04b5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186678311}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "56e15bb6-b6d0-5170-b17c-c7ec6bfda498" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}